        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We designed our platform using a flexible, service-oriented architecture in order to facilitate rapid development of new solutions, to meet evolving industry demands, and to support new use cases and new ad formats.",
        "start_character": 20481,
        "end_character": 20696
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will continue to invest in our go to market efforts to sell our emerging offerings such as Connect, Activate, and Convert, which drives new revenues streams, as well as our offerings such as Intelligent Yield and Access Membership.",
        "start_character": 14785,
        "end_character": 15019
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Because both our company and our buyers rely upon large volumes of such data collected primarily through cookies and other tracking technologies, it is essential that we monitor legal requirements and other developments in this area, domestically and globally, maintain a robust privacy and security compliance program, and engage in responsible privacy practices, including providing consumers with notice of the types of data we collect, how we collect it, with whom we share it, how we use that data to provide our solutions, and the applicable choices we offer consumers.",
        "start_character": 30967,
        "end_character": 31542
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Finally, we own and operate our proprietary software and hardware infrastructure around the world which saves significant costs and gives us the efficiencies, control, and independence compared to companies that rely on public cloud alternatives.",
        "start_character": 11850,
        "end_character": 12096
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In connection with these initiatives, we have developed internal systems and processes designed to capture, evaluate, and transmit consent, opt-in, and opt-out signals within bid requests and related transactions.",
        "start_character": 19568,
        "end_character": 19781
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have designed our technology to efficiently process real-time advertising transactions while leveraging data to optimize outcomes for publishers and buyers.",
        "start_character": 20157,
        "end_character": 20316
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We own and operate our software and hardware infrastructure globally, which saves significant infrastructure expenditures as compared to public cloud alternatives.",
        "start_character": 20317,
        "end_character": 20480
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We primarily work with large publishers and app developers who allow us direct access to their ad inventory, as well as select channel partners that meet our quality and scale thresholds.",
        "start_character": 6193,
        "end_character": 6380
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "•Built in Quality Controls: We have developed a multi-pronged strategy to create a high-quality marketplace beginning with high quality publisher selection, supported by proprietary and third-party fraud detection software, manual review, timely fraud investigations, and a fraud-free program in which buyers are credited for any fraudulent inventory they may have purchased on our platform.",
        "start_character": 22076,
        "end_character": 22467
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Global, Omnichannel Reach: We are a global business with distributed critical infrastructure and a go-to-market presence in every major advertising market in the world outside of China.",
        "start_character": 9260,
        "end_character": 9445
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe through products like Intelligent Yield and AI Insights demonstrate that we are deploying AI in a manner that improves speed, performance, and outcomes faster than many of our competitors.",
        "start_character": 8331,
        "end_character": 8543
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001422930-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001422930-26-000010-07b217bdcc387a58",
        "accession_number": "0001422930-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are also investing in AI products that are creating incremental revenue streams such as Intelligent Yield for publishers, which uses adaptive learning models to automate pricing and improve auction efficiency.",
        "start_character": 7082,
        "end_character": 7294
      }
